# Screenshots and archives must never be treated as text.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true. Git's binary
# auto-detection has held so far, but a PNG that gets line-ending translation
# applied is silently corrupted, and the damage only shows up as a broken image
# on GitHub - long after the commit that caused it.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary

# Shell scripts and the plugin's own text assets keep LF, so a clone on Linux
# gets something runnable rather than something with carriage returns in the
# shebang line.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
